<title>UK: GUS, British Land confirm JV talks.</title>
<headline>GUS, British Land confirm JV talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Land Co Plc and Great Universal Stores Plc confirmed on Monday that they were in discussions regarding formation of a joint venture.</p>
<p>The possible venture would purchase and manage most of the investment property interests of Great Universal.</p>
<p>&quot;The discussions have not been finalised and a further announcement will be made when appropriate&quot;, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
